     1,
     "<div>Hi team camtrapR!</div><div><br></div>I am having some issues loading camtrapR.<div><span role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;border:none;outline:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:837px;font-size:10pt\"><span align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10pt\"><br><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;font-size:10pt\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"color:blue\">library(camtrapR)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error: package or namespace load failed for ‘camtrapR’ in loadNamespace(j &lt;- i[[1L]], c(lib.loc, .libPaths()), versionCheck = vI[[j]]):\r\n there is no package called ‘e1071’\r\n</span></span></span></span><span align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10pt\"><br></span><span align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10pt\"><span role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:831px\"><span align=\"left\" width=\"1\" height=\"\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10pt\"><div style=\"color:blue\">\r\n<div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">I have installed the latest version of the package and have an up to date version of R ( 4.3.3) and Rstudio (<span style=\"color:rgb(23,33,43);font-family:&quot;Source Code Pro&quot;,monospace;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.48px;text-transform:uppercase\">RSTUDIO-2023.12.1-402.EXE</span>).</div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">I have tried installing the package &#39;stringi&#39; but it fails to install. </div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">Any ideas on how might be able to troubleshoot this? sometime ago,  I have successfully added and used camtrapR on an older version of R. But this time , It seems no possible this time.</div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">Please help me! Thank you!!!</div>\r\n\r\n</div></span></span></span></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
